the list is great, thanks for the quick answers.

Original problem below.

Solution: Sort should know that the fields are numeric. Therfore adding "n"
does the job:

    sort -t . -k 12n -k 11n <file>

Again thanks a lot. Have a nice day.

Werner Rost

